zcode-expert-orchestrator
Copyright (c) mario841859784 and contributors

This plugin is a ZCode-native port of dsh-expert-orchestrator
(https://github.com/mario841859784/dsh-expert-orchestrator, MIT). The 11
bundled-core expert prompts (plugins/expert-orchestrator/skills/
expert-orchestration/experts/, MIT, same as this repository) were authored
for the dsh-expert-orchestrator project and are imported here at port time;
updates flow one-way via scripts/sync-from-dsh.mjs.

The Python tools under plugins/expert-orchestrator/skills/
expert-orchestration/tools/ (taskboard.py, bus.py, _ed25519.py) are
byte-identical copies of the upstream dsh-expert-orchestrator sources and
carry the same MIT license.
